* (inquired) who had used any prescription drugs, over-the-counter drugs, nutricals, herbal products or received vaccines within 14 days before the trial;
* (Inquiry) Mechanical operators who are engaged in high-altitude work, motor vehicle driving and other associated hazards;
* (inquiry) can not tolerate venipuncture and/or have a history of dizziness;
* (asked) who had used any drugs in the year before the test;
* alcohol breath test results \&gt; 0.0mg/100mL or drug abuse screening positive (morphine, methamphetamines, ketamine, dimethylenedioxyamphetamine, tetrahydrocannabinol acid, cocaine);
* subjects who were considered by the investigator to have poor adherence or any factor that precluded participation in the trial.

